{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"概形上的层语义"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"概形上的层语义"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>代数的谱</h3>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>. 设 $R$ 为局部环, $A$ 为 $R$-代数. 定义 $A$ 的<strong>综合谱</strong> (synthetic spectrum) 为代数同态的集合\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Spec}A = \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Alg}(R)}(A,R).\r\n$$</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>. 设 $X$ 为概形, $A$ 为 $\\mathcal O_X$-代数. 那么在 $X$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"大Zariski意象","text":"大 Zariski 意象"}},{"Plain":" $\\operatorname{Zar}(X)$ 中, $A^{\\mathrm{Zar}}$ 的综合谱即为"},{"Local":{"url":"相对谱","text":"相对谱"}},{"Plain":" $\\underline{\\operatorname{Spec}}_X(A)$.</p>\n<h3>拟凝聚层</h3>\n<p><strong>定义</strong> (综合拟凝聚性, "},{"Local":{"url":"IngoBlechschmidtInternalLanguageAG","text":"Ingo"}},{"Plain":" Definition 18.18).\n设 $R$ 为局部环, $E$ 为 $R$-模. 若典范的 $R$-模同态\n$$\r\nE \\otimes_R A \\to E^{\\operatorname{Spec}A},\\,\r\n(x\\otimes f) \\mapsto (\\varphi\\mapsto \\varphi(f)x)\r\n$$\n为同构, 则称 $E$ 为<strong>综合拟凝聚</strong> (synthetically quasicoherent) $R$-模.</p>\n"}]}}